[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0010","text":"────嗯，不错嘛\n衣服很合身哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0020","text":"哦～\n呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0030","text":"那么，为了纪念第一次穿\n来拍张照吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0040","text":"OK——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0050","text":"我会拍几张\n你能随便摆几个姿势吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0060","text":"嗯～\n那，正面"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0070","text":"侧面"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0080","text":"背面"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0090","text":"另一边的侧面"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0100","text":"耶——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12000100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
